# The inputs of the RC-10d install images (KIND=release): INSTALLER_COMMIT = release data 3 of mainline-rc-10d (the
# unit-6 fixes: the info file on every poll and the unlock word after the write, the copy's bar every 500 ms, the plain
# words of the unit's screens of the cable path; the RC-10d base 0.2.0-rc10d-base in step2set; board.sh 27c62b85 in the
# both-slot gate). Every other value is that of mainline-rc10c-donetext-install.inputs, also the times. New tokens
# (used by no other inputs file). image/build.sh --install --board both --inputs THIS-FILE, from INSTALLER_COMMIT. The
# images are for no unit until the release review names their sha256 and the safety rules name the image and the unit.
